# CLAUDE.md — operating manual for {{ project_name }}

A uv-managed FastAPI backend (agent framework: **{{ agent_framework }}**). Generated
from python_backend_manager. Read `AGENTS.md` for full conventions.

## Golden rules
1. uv only — `uv add` / `uv sync` / `uv run`. Never call `pip`.
2. Settings via `app.core.config.get_settings()`; logging via `app.core.logging`.
   Never read `os.environ` or use bare `print`/`logging` in app code.
3. Async-first FastAPI; JSON via `ORJSONResponse`.
4. One agent framework only ({{ agent_framework }}). Model tiers come from settings
   (`model_fast` / `model_default` / `model_frontier`) — default to the cheapest that works.
5. Run `/check` before declaring any task done.
6. Keep edited Python ruff-clean (a PostToolUse hook formats on save).

## Staying current
- Libraries: `just upgrade` (uv lock --upgrade) + Renovate.
- Template: `just template-update` (copier update) pulls upstream template changes.

## Subagents (read-only)
- `code-reviewer` — review a diff for correctness, async pitfalls, and convention breaks.
- `build-judge` — PASS/FAIL a feature against its acceptance criteria + next-prompt.

The parent owns edits/commits; subagents only read + report.
